<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Bank Queensland yr net profit falls.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Bank Queensland yr net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to August 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    36.65 vs 32.84</p>
<p>    Net				     21.66 vs 22.67</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	    16.0  vs 14.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Bank of Queensland Ltd is a Queensland-based regional bank.</p>
</text>
